# ScriptPlayerActor: Temple Grounds 0n_temple_hall (3bfa3eff) layer 0: e0008005c "PlayerActor Samus"
# (flags 0x84: 0x80 = wait for Increment). AreaLoaded while active defers the load until Increment
# (Think returns early), then Increment clears the wait.
@f300 god 1
@f320 obj e0008005c
@f340 send e0008005c Activate
@f500 send e0008005c AreaLoaded
@f700 obj e0008005c
@f720 send e0008005c Increment
@f900 obj e0008005c
@f1000 send e0008005c Deactivate
@f1300 send e0008005c Delete
